<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK JAN-MAY TRADE GAP WIDENS TO SKK 29.859 BLN.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK JAN-MAY TRADE GAP WIDENS TO SKK 29.859 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's foreign trade deficit totalled 29.859 billion crowns for the first five months of the year, up from a 25.674 billion crown shortfall for the same period in 1996, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The trade deficit was 27.908 billion crowns for the first four months of 1997.</p>
